  textData:
  - textID: poor_01
    textContents: I understand you're new, but today's performance was unacceptable.
      You have to do better tomorrow.
  - textID: poor_02
    textContents: Get your head in the game! Your productivity was way under today.
      Make sure you're back up to speed tomorrow.
  - textID: fair_01
    textContents: Today was okay, but I know you can do better. Try to do more tasks
      tomorrow, we can't fall behind now.
  - textID: fair_02
    textContents: You did alright today, but maybe you could try to get more of your
      tasks done tomorrow?
  - textID: good_01
    textContents: Wow, you really went above and beyond today!
  - textID: good_02
    textContents: 'Keep it up, sport, that bonus will be yours in no time. '
  - textID: good_03
    textContents: You sure you're only entry level? That might've been a big understatement.
      Great work today!
  - textID: nostim_01
    textContents: You have a perscription for a reason, you know. Maybe you should
      give it a look next time, it might help.
  - textID: nostim_02
    textContents: Neglecting your medication isn't going to do you any good. Consider
      taking a look at your meds next shift.
  - textID: lowstim_01
    textContents: You've followed the perscription according to the bottle.
  - textID: highstim_01
    textContents: The recommended amount for your medication is [x] mg per day. Try
      slowing it down a bit on your next shift.
  - textID: highstim_02
    textContents: Your recommended dose is [x] mg per day. Maybe you should try to
      take a little less for tomorrow's shift.
  overallScore: []
